// Wyrm, is a world unit: one in the world, never trained. It moves as Drifa does (3 moves, over
// impassable terrain at a plain move's cost). It has no Dragon promotion (that one gives Fear), so
// its Breath Fire is its own copy of the dragons' spell. Rules: crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/world_spells_2.rs.
