    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_DRAGONS_OATH_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Dragon's Oath.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Sylvarith, the Singing Wyrm, joins you in your capital: a large dragon, HP 180, attack 150, defence 120, 3 moves over any terrain, Breath Fire. It has no Fear.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]One Sylvarith in the world: not while another lives.",
